34:44.606 --> 34:45.957
Have you lost your mind?

34:56.285 --> 34:58.303
Those glasses...

34:58.704 --> 35:00.221
What?

35:00.789 --> 35:02.795
Did you always wear them?

35:02.875 --> 35:06.561
My eyes have gone bad.

35:11.967 --> 35:14.736
What are you doing? Give them back.

35:16.263 --> 35:19.144
You can see something
with these on, can't you?

35:19.224 --> 35:22.494
What are you talking about?

35:24.188 --> 35:25.872
Red lines.

35:29.693 --> 35:33.338
Can you see them, too?

35:34.823 --> 35:39.969
Then, how many lines do I have on my head?

35:42.164 --> 35:43.765
One.

35:46.460 --> 35:47.714
Choi Da-hye has five.

35:47.794 --> 35:50.759
Kim Hye-yeong has two,
one with the Korean teacher.

35:50.839 --> 35:52.344
Choi I-seul has over ten.

35:52.424 --> 35:55.527
The gym teacher is having an affair.
Shall I continue?

35:57.095 --> 35:58.863
How?

36:00.599 --> 36:02.575
Where did you get these glasses from?

36:03.852 --> 36:05.703
I just found them.

36:09.858 --> 36:13.253
That's the truth.
They were in my locker.

36:20.994 --> 36:22.040
Give them back.

36:22.120 --> 36:23.625
These are dangerous.

36:23.705 --> 36:25.794
How can glasses be dangerous?

36:25.874 --> 36:28.797
You know what happened
to your neighbor recently, right?

36:28.877 --> 36:31.133
That man was wearing these glasses.

36:31.213 --> 36:32.981
He saw the S lines.

36:34.049 --> 36:39.237
S lines?
Oh, so that's what they're called.

36:40.138 --> 36:41.739
So what?

36:45.435 --> 36:47.370
I couldn't care less about who made them

36:47.479 --> 36:49.747
or who it originally belonged to

36:51.692 --> 36:53.501
These are mine.

37:01.493 --> 37:03.136
Hey, Teach.

37:03.328 --> 37:04.971
Yes?

37:05.247 --> 37:08.128
You have a Seon-a in your class,
don't you? A Kang Seon-a?

37:08.208 --> 37:10.101
Yes, I do. Why do you ask?

37:10.460 --> 37:12.925
What's she like?

37:13.005 --> 37:15.511
She hasn't been behaving
in my class recently...

37:15.591 --> 37:17.483
Oh, really?

37:18.176 --> 37:20.933
She hasn't had any issues recently.

37:21.013 --> 37:22.726
Do you want me to talk to her?

37:22.806 --> 37:24.520
Oh, really?

37:24.600 --> 37:27.189
No, it's fine. I'll try talking to her.

37:27.269 --> 37:28.870
Okay.

37:39.489 --> 37:40.953
You're looking at my S line, aren't you?

37:41.033 --> 37:42.634
I'm not.

37:44.786 --> 37:48.973
But do you know how to get rid of them?

37:58.925 --> 38:00.693
Not sure.

38:03.096 --> 38:06.115
Maybe the partner just needs to die?

38:09.186 --> 38:12.818
Are you going to hold onto those glasses?

38:12.898 --> 38:16.029
Of course.

38:16.109 --> 38:18.753
I'm going to show them
how pitiful they really are.

38:41.426 --> 38:44.862
PREPARE 20 MILLION WON

39:12.249 --> 39:13.975
Is it your first time?

39:16.253 --> 39:17.895
No.

39:21.633 --> 39:23.192
Are you okay?

39:34.187 --> 39:39.363
I HAVE THE 20 MILLION WON.
MEET ME ON THE SCHOOL ROOFTOP AT MIDNIGHT.

39:39.443 --> 39:41.085
Who is it?

39:43.321 --> 39:44.743
My financier.

39:44.823 --> 39:46.674
Where do you want to go?

39:48.201 --> 39:49.844
What?

39:49.953 --> 39:51.721
What about coin karaoke?

39:57.127 --> 40:05.485
PHOTO BOOTH

40:08.221 --> 40:09.476
What are you doing?

40:09.556 --> 40:10.811
That's not going to work.

40:10.891 --> 40:12.950
Let's check out over there.

40:25.822 --> 40:27.536
What's that?

40:27.616 --> 40:29.371
They're mine.

40:29.451 --> 40:33.721
So you should just keep
your mouth shut, too.

41:12.786 --> 41:15.805
What's with that face?

41:16.122 --> 41:18.099
The ones on top came out really nice.

41:25.507 --> 41:27.066
Damn it!

41:28.718 --> 41:30.265
What's wrong?

41:30.345 --> 41:31.946
What the?

41:37.018 --> 41:40.955
Excuse me, did you find
a pair of glasses over there, by chance?

42:17.517 --> 42:18.271
Hello?

42:18.351 --> 42:20.774
It's you, isn't it? You took them!

42:20.854 --> 42:21.775
What are you talking about?

42:21.855 --> 42:24.820
My glasses! They're gone!

42:24.900 --> 42:27.823
Glasses? What are you talking about?

42:27.903 --> 42:29.115
Damn it. I'm late.

42:29.195 --> 42:30.784
Where are you right now?

42:30.864 --> 42:34.467
I have to get to school right now.
I'll talk to you later.

42:35.911 --> 42:38.166
School? Why are you going
to school at this hour?

42:38.246 --> 42:41.182
Hello? Hey!

42:50.592 --> 42:52.485
BANGJU HIGH SCHOOL

43:16.618 --> 43:19.595
I haven't been on the roof in a while.

43:22.082 --> 43:24.725
But how did you know it was me?

43:25.752 --> 43:30.398
Oh. Hye-yeong must have told you.

43:31.883 --> 43:34.264
Nobody saw you come up here, right?

43:34.344 --> 43:37.225
What's the point of asking that?

43:37.305 --> 43:38.948
Where's the money?

43:39.182 --> 43:41.784
You shouldn't live your life like that.

43:44.646 --> 43:46.902
All of a sudden?

43:46.982 --> 43:50.459
Then, should I be more like you?

43:52.028 --> 43:53.617
You were an outcast anyway, right?

43:53.697 --> 43:55.298
Not anymore.

43:59.536 --> 44:05.170
Please, Seon-a. I have a child.
My second will be born soon.

44:05.250 --> 44:08.298
What will my family do
if I get fired from here?

44:08.378 --> 44:11.718
And where would I suddenly get
20 million from on a teacher's salary?

44:11.798 --> 44:14.012
You people all knew
that I was getting bullied,

44:14.092 --> 44:19.309
by Kim Hye-yeong and Choi I-seul.

44:19.389 --> 44:21.782
But, you guys just ignored it.

44:22.976 --> 44:24.272
All because of Choi I-seul's parents.

44:24.352 --> 44:29.110
Seon-a, let me apologize to you
on behalf of everyone. I mean it.

44:29.190 --> 44:30.916
Don't be ridiculous.

44:33.278 --> 44:36.672
Seon-a, then how about this?

44:36.823 --> 44:39.120
Let's just delete
that photo on your phone first.

44:39.200 --> 44:43.137
Then, I'll get you that money
some way, somehow tomorrow.

44:57.177 --> 44:58.306
WIFE

44:58.386 --> 44:59.975
EXPLAIN THIS.

45:00.055 --> 45:04.283
HOW COULD YOU DO THIS TO ME?

45:12.400 --> 45:14.418
You sent it?

45:17.947 --> 45:20.203
You sent it already?

45:20.283 --> 45:22.051
What are you talking about?

45:23.078 --> 45:24.833
Why?

45:24.913 --> 45:26.681
Why?

46:34.566 --> 46:36.375
Seon-a.

47:09.758 --> 47:11.247
You must be looking for evidence.

47:11.327 --> 47:12.902
Who are you?

47:13.262 --> 47:15.559
I'm Lee Gyeong-jin from Class 5.

47:15.639 --> 47:17.657
So you think it was a suicide attempt?

47:19.685 --> 47:22.245
Do you happen to know who these belong to?

47:22.604 --> 47:25.206
Try them on. I bet they suit you.

47:29.695 --> 47:33.410
I heard you almost got married.
What happened?

47:33.490 --> 47:35.245
not long before the wedding,

47:35.325 --> 47:37.873
saw her in bed with my friend.

47:37.953 --> 47:39.666
Having it happen before the wedding

47:39.746 --> 47:43.016
is the best luck you can get.

47:43.333 --> 47:45.130
If you found out

47:45.210 --> 47:48.438
someone you knew was having an affair,

47:48.714 --> 47:50.398
what would you do?

47:50.841 --> 47:53.972
I'd let everybody know

47:54.052 --> 47:56.404
and let all hell break loose.

48:00.601 --> 48:04.037
RED LINES THAT CONNECT SEXUAL PARTNERS
